@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Doxastic vs epistemic disagreement through OWL disjointness kept in the shared world.
:S { :InFrance owl:disjointWith :InLondon . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:K { :w a :InLondon . }
:narr :knows :K . :knows a dec:epistemicPredicate .
:B { :w a :InFrance . }
:mary :believes :B . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
[] dec:checkInconsistencies true .
